Yes, it worked with previous versions. I'm using this quite often and would notice it not working multiple times a day. Article was not helpful because it does not involve 3rd party automator actions.
Action is trivial and works (tested) in other apps as it always worked. Firefox which is my primary web browser, after update stopped working.
Action has only default actions. Flow:
1. Workflow receives current text from any application
2. Runs Javascript:
```
function run(input, parameters) {
	var output = "http://translate.google.com/translate_t?sl=en&tl=lt&text=" + encodeURI(input);
	return output;
}
```
3. Shows safari pop-up which navigates to a google translate location with selected text to translate

